# ─── Model weights ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SD-Turbo weights are fetched from Hugging Face on demand and cached in the
# browser's IndexedDB — never commit them. For the local WGSL U-Net path you can
# drop a copy of `unet.onnx` in the repo root (see README → "Models"); it stays
# ignored. The 1.65 GB U-Net is exactly why this rule exists.
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.ort
*.safetensors
*.pb

# ─── Node ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ─── Python (onnx_surgery.py, scope tooling) ─────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ─── OS / editor cruft ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/

# ─── Scratch / logs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
tmp/
scratch/
